					<paragraph lineSpacing="1_1_2"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["We accept payment by cash, check and electronic payments by card and check (fees associated with electronic payments). For phone payments, please call us at (509) 962-7201 or toll free (855) 529-2439 or you can pay online at <u>www.ellensburgwa.gov</u> and select the Pay Utility Bill option. If you have any questions or would like to make payment arrangements, please call us at (509) 962-7201. Thank you for your immediate attention to this matter. If payment has been made, thank you for your payment and please disregard this notice. <br /><br />"]]></textFieldExpression>
